<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Form 4868 Template</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        h1, h2, h3, h4 { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif; }
        .section-header { font-weight: bold; }
        .form-label { font-weight: normal; }
        .input-field { border-bottom: 1px solid #000; min-width: 100px; }
        .two-column { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
        .two-column > div { width: 48%; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 10px; }
        td { padding: 5px 0; }
        .divider { border-top: 1px solid #000; margin: 20px 0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
        <div>
            <h2 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">4868</h2>
            <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Department of the Treasury</p>
            <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Internal Revenue Service</p>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: right;">
            <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Application for Automatic Extension of Time</p>
            <p style="font-size: 12pt;">To File U.S. Individual Income Tax Return</p>
            <p style="font-size: 12pt;">OMB No. 1545-0188</p>
            <div style="font-size: 24pt; margin-top: 10px;">1998</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">General Instructions</h3>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Purpose of Form</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Use Form 4868 to apply for 4 more months to file Form 1040EZ, Form 1040A, Form 1040, Form 1040NR-EZ, or Form 1040NR.</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">To get the extra time you must:</p>
    <ul style="font-size: 10pt; padding-left: 20px;">
        <li>Properly estimate your 1998 tax liability using the information available to you.</li>
        <li>Pay your tax liability to the IRS by the due date of your return.</li>
        <li>File Form 4868 by the regular due date of your return.</li>
    </ul>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">You are not required to send a payment of the tax you estimate as due. However, see Interest and Late Payment Penalty on page 3. Any remittance you send with this form will not extend the time to file your tax return.</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">You do not have to explain why you are asking for the extension. We will contact you only if your request is denied.</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Do not file Form 4868 if you want the IRS to figure your tax or you are under a court order to file your return by the regular due date.</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">If you need an additional extension, see if you Need Additional Time on this page.</p>

    <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">Out of the Country</h3>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">If you already had 2 extra months to file because you were a U.S. citizen or resident and were out of the country, use this form to obtain an additional 2 months to file. Write "Taxpayer" in the box across the top of Form 4868.</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">This means either (a) you live outside the United States and Puerto Rico, or (b) you are in military or naval service outside the United States and Puerto Rico.</p>

    <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
        <p style="font-size: 10pt;">For Privacy Act and Paperwork Reduction Act notice, see page 4.</p>
        <div style="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt;">
            <span data-field="form_number">{{ form_number }}</span> (1998)
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt;">
            <span data-field="form_date">{{ form_date }}</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
        <div>
            <h2 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">4868</h2>
            <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Department of the Treasury</p>
            <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Internal Revenue Service</p>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: right;">
