    </div>

    <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">Part II Individual Income Tax</h3>
    <table style="margin-top: 10px;">
        <tr>
            <td style="width: 20%;">4 Total tax liability on your income tax return for 1998 $</td>
            <td style="width: 30%;"><span data-field="total_tax_liability">{{ total_tax_liability }}</span></td>
            <td style="width: 10%;"></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>5 Total 1998 payments</td>
            <td><span data-field="total_payments">{{ total_payments }}</span></td>
            <td></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>6 Balance. Subtract 5 from 4</td>
            <td><span data-field="balance_due">{{ balance_due }}</span></td>
            <td></td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">Part III Gift/GST Tax</h3>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">If you are not filing a gift or GST tax return, go to Part V now. See the instructions.</p>

    <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">Part IV Total</h3>
    <table style="margin-top: 10px;">
        <tr>
            <td style="width: 20%;">9 Total liability. Add lines 6, 7, and 8 $</td>
            <td style="width: 30%;"><span data-field="total_liability_gift">{{ total_liability_gift }}</span></td>
            <td style="width: 10%;"></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>10 Amount you are paying.</td>
            <td><span data-field="amount_paid_gift">{{ amount_paid_gift }}</span></td>
            <td></td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 10px;">If line 10 is less than line 9, you may be liable for interest and penalties. See page 3.</p>

    <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
        <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Yourself [ ] Spouse [ ]</p>
    </div>
</div>

